<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY ONE-MONTH BILL YIELD RISES TO 21.33 PCT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY ONE-MONTH BILL YIELD RISES TO 21.33 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on</p>
<p>the latest issue of one-month discount treasury bills was set</p>
<p>by auction at 21.33 percent, up from 20.70 percent at an</p>
<p>auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency</p>
<p>said. Full details of the auction follow.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	2,549.53 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	  21.33 percent</p>
<p>    Average price		   98.3901 percent</p>
</text>
